MilkFlint packages: licences

The packages under targets/ are other projects' work (the Linux kernel,
OpenWrt, mt76 and others), built by MilkFlint and passed on under their own
licences. This repository doesn't relicense them. Each package names its
licence in its metadata (apk info -a <package>): most are GPL-2.0-only;
others are GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-3.0, Apache-2.0, or BSD-3-Clause-Clear
(the mt76 drivers' firmware). Where to get their source: SOURCE.txt in each
feed's folder.

This repository's own files (README.md, index.html, 404.html, logo.svg,
feeds.tsv, LICENSE) are under the GPL-2.0: LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt.
